{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:25 2026-11-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:25 2026-11-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:25 2026-11-19 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8fed6f1c516324c13c21549502676c83/2026-11/FotoJet_15.jpg\"/><p>保安局在社交平台介紹最近舉行「全港學界國家安全常識挑戰賽」半準決賽的情況，今年戰況緊張刺激。現場設有「即答即獎」遊戲，答中的學生可獲小禮物。當中有學生回答國安問題「快狠準」，更連中三元「攞到成手都係禮物」。是項挑戰賽的總決賽將於明年4月15日舉行，同學們向冠軍進發。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:44:08.561262+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:25:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T06:57:31.569702+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:37:32.302917+00:00","content_hash":"970b275d3f431ca88ef444138cafa5538e3f04eac396081d402f74118ec90e75","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}